## What this monorepo is

`better-toolkits` is a curated marketplace of source-available Claude Code (and
related agent-harness) toolkits for **developer lifecycle optimization,
architectural auditing, and startup validation**.

Each toolkit under `toolkits/<name>/` is separately licensed under BSL-1.1 —
see that toolkit's `LICENSE`. This repository's root `LICENSE` covers the
monorepo curation, marketplace manifest, shared docs, and any material that
does not carry its own LICENSE.

